<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταργ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leave unemployed</i> or <i>idle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					753
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηργηκέναι τοὺς καιρούς</span>
			<i>to have missed</i> the opportunities, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				176
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὴν γῆν</span>
			<i>make</i> the ground <i>useless, cumber</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				13.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cause to be idle, hinder</i> in one's work, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Es.</u>
				4.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				38.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Es.</u>
				6.8
			</span></i>; <i>to be rendered</i> or <i>lie idle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				176.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make of no effect,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Rom.
				3.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				31
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be abolished, cease</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἀπὸ τοῦ νόμου</span>
			<i>to be set free</i> from . . , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>; <i>to be parted</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ Χριστοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
					5.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
